== Tips ==
* It is extremely cheap for most players to buy the required {{Item|Revenant Flesh}} from the [[Bazaar]], so they can upgrade the {{Item|Zombie Talisman}} almost immediately after unlocking the recipe.

== Trivia ==
* The {{Item|Zombie Artifact}}, '''Zombie Ring''', and {{Item|Zombie Talisman}} used to stack to get {{Green|30%}} reduced damage taken from {{MobSprite|Zombie}}s.

